  "notes": [
    "FOR WIRING SEE RPO C60",
    "Solenoid & carburetor adjustment: 1. Turn the carb idle speed screw 1/2 turn clockwise. 2. Loosely mount solenoid in bracket. 3. Closed throttle, choke fully off. 4. With solenoid energized (plunger out), slide it in the bracket until the plunger just touches the carb lever; tighten. 5. Back the idle screw out one full turn.",
    "NOTE: should give about 500 RPM idle with solenoid de-energized."
